## 💡 Delay Reduction Recommendations

| # | Recommendation | Cause Addressed | Est. Impact |
|---|---------------|----------------|-------------|
| 1 | **Schedule buffer at hub airports** (ORD, DFW, ATL) to prevent cascade | Late Aircraft (39%) | ↓ 39% of volume |
| 2 | **Predictive maintenance + crew scheduling AI** for carrier delays | Carrier (34%) | ↓ 34% controllable |
| 3 | **NextGen ATC automation** + slot coordination upgrades | NAS (22%) | ↓ 22% NAS delays |
| 4 | **Seasonal capacity adjustment** — reduce density in Jun–Aug & Dec | Seasonal spikes | ↓ 20% peak delays |
| 5 | **Hub decongestion strategy** at top 3 airports via FAA collaboration | System-wide | ↓ 30%+ system-wide |
| 6 | **Weather intelligence integration** for real-time re-routing | Weather (5%) | ↓ 15–30% impact |

